{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Grade of a Module.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Grade of a Module.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"grade of a module grade of a module","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Grade of a Module.md","fileName":"Grade of a Module.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Grade of a Module","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-13 20:25\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Local Cohomology and Rees Algebra]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local Cohomology and Rees Algebra","Support of a Module","commutativealgebra.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Grade of a Module.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Grade of a Module.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"grade of a module grade of a module","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Grade of a Module.md","fileName":"Grade of a Module.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Grade of a Module","heading":"Grade of a Module","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"For a finitely generated module M over a Noetherian ring, grade(M) is the smallest i for which Extⁱ_R(M,R) is nonzero. It also equals the depth of R with respect to Ann(M).\n\nGrade measures how far the module's support lies from being detected by ordinary Hom. The source relates it to depths of localized rings at primes in [[Support of a Module|Supp(M)]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local Cohomology and Rees Algebra","Support of a Module","commutativealgebra.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Grade of a Module.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Grade of a Module.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"grade of a module grade of a module","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Grade of a Module.md","fileName":"Grade of a Module.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Grade